              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Ravished"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe has proven to be the most tasty bread of the ones I've prevriously tried. Only difference that I make is I use 1c of milk as opposed to 3/4 cup of water. It makes a petite loaf of bread that is absolutely perfect.",
